#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.lon.apm.py:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Automatically switches personality to \"Aggressive\" below 30 km/h and "
"restores your selected personality above 40 km/h."
msgstr ""
"在车速低于 30 km/h 时自动切换为“激进”个性，并在超过 40 km/h 时恢复你所选的个"
"性。"

